# The bootable CP/M 3 system card on IDE/CF drive 0 (A:). The image is truncated to the live
# filesystem; the rest of the declared 7806960-sector (~3.72 GB) CompactFlash card reads back as
# erased 0xFF. The combination BIOS assigns A: to CF drive 0 (reference/dual-ide-card.md).
sector_size 512
sectors     7806960
